</div>
<div class="ltx_listingline" id="lstnumberx503">
<span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">h1</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">:</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">n</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_literate ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"><math alttext="\mid" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="lstnumberx503.m1"><semantics><mo mathbackground="#F7F7F7">∣</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">p</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">-</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">1))</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">h2</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">:</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">p</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_literate ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"><math alttext="\mid" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="lstnumberx503.m2"><semantics><mo mathbackground="#F7F7F7">∣</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">n</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">^6</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">-</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">1))</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">:</span>
</div>
<div class="ltx_listingline" id="lstnumberx504">
<span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_literate ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"><math alttext="\exists" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="lstnumberx504.m1"><semantics><mo mathbackground="#F7F7F7">∃</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\exists</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">k</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">:</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_literate ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"><math alttext="\mathbb{N}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="lstnumberx504.m2"><semantics><mi mathbackground="#F7F7F7">ℕ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">,</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">p</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">-</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">n</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">=</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">k</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">^2)</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_literate ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"><math alttext="\lor" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="lstnumberx504.m3"><semantics><mo mathbackground="#F7F7F7">∨</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">p</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">+</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">n</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">=</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">k</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">^2)</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">:=</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;color:#0000FF;">by</span>
</div>
<div class="ltx_listingline" id="lstnumberx505">
<span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;color:#0000FF;">sorry</span>
</div>
</div>
<p class="ltx_p"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">problem:
<br class="ltx_break"/></span>NT3. Let <math alttext="n&gt;1" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.SS1.p3.m1"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math> be a positive integer and <math alttext="p" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.SS1.p3.m2"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math> a prime number such that <math alttext="n\mid(p-1)" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.SS1.p3.m3"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∣</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\mid(p-1)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math alttext="p\mid(n^{6}-1)" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.SS1.p3.m4"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∣</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p\mid(n^{6}-1)</annotation></semantics></math>. Prove that at least one of the numbers <math alttext="p-n" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.SS1.p3.m5"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p-n</annotation></semantics></math> and <math alttext="p+n" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.SS1.p3.m6"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p+n</annotation></semantics></math> is a perfect square.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" id="S7.SS1.p4">
<p class="ltx_p"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 2 (Number Theory):
<br class="ltx_break"/>Lean 4 statement:</span></p>
