<div class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" id="S7.SS2.p25">
<p class="ltx_p">Now, use the same process for the following three items:</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S7.SS2.p26">
<p class="ltx_p">{<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">theorem</span>}</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S7.SS2.p27">
<p class="ltx_p">{<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">initial_plan</span>}</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S7.SS2.p28">
<p class="ltx_p">{<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">stuck_subgoal</span>}</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S7.SS2.p29">
<p class="ltx_p">You must follow all the instructions and mandatory rules above. After deep consideration, provide the complete, refined Lean 4 plan.</p>
</div>
